OL,4,BDead hippo to be honoured on football  
OL,5,Bclub tifo                              
OL,6,GMajor League Soccer side FC Cincinnati 
OL,7,Gwill honour Fiona, a hippo that        
OL,8,Grecently died at the city's zoo, with  
OL,9,Ga tifo display at their match with     
OL,10,GNashville SC on Saturday.              
OL,12,FFiona, a social media star since her   
OL,13,Fpremature birth at the zoo in 2017,    
OL,14,Fdied on Thursday after swallowing a    
OL,15,Fwoollen hat that had slipped into her  
OL,16,Fenclosure.                             
